# Licensed terrain tile pack — served from R2 (TERRAIN_ASSETS) in prod via
# /api/sprites, local mirror in dev. NOT committed to this public repo.
# The generated manifest IS tracked (just filenames; the client loads it from
# /Sprites/terrain-manifest.json, and prod needs it in the build).
